# 4️⃣ WHY DOES ML CARE ABOUT SLOPE?

Imagine this is the loss function:

```text
Loss
 ↑
 │\
 │ \
 │  \
 │   \____
 │        \____
 │             \
 └────────────────→ Parameter
```

We want:

```text
LOWEST LOSS
```

So the model needs to determine:

> Which direction should I move?

The derivative provides that information.

