# 5️⃣ SIMPLE DERIVATIVE EXAMPLE

Consider:

$$
f(x)=x^2
$$

Derivative:

$$
f'(x)=2x
$$

At:

```text
x = 5
```

we get:

$$
f'(5)=10
$$

At:

```text
x = -5
```

we get:

$$
f'(-5)=-10
$$

Notice:

```text
x = +5 → positive gradient
x = -5 → negative gradient
```

This tells us which direction we should move.

