# 1️⃣8️⃣ BACKPROPAGATION

Conceptually:

```text
Forward Pass
─────────────────────→

Input → Layer → Layer → Prediction
                         ↓
                        Loss

←───────────────────────
     Backward Pass
     Gradients
```

Forward:

```text
Calculate prediction
```

Backward:

```text
Calculate gradients
```

Then:

```text
Update weights
```

So:

```text
Forward propagation
        ↓
Loss
        ↓
Backpropagation
        ↓
Gradients
        ↓
Gradient descent
        ↓
Updated weights
```

🔥 This is the foundation of neural-network training.

