# 2️⃣4️⃣ COMMON MISTAKES 🚨

### ❌ Mistake 1

Thinking gradient means loss.

No.

```text
Loss → how wrong
Gradient → how loss changes
```

---

### ❌ Mistake 2

Thinking gradient descent follows the gradient.

It follows the **negative gradient**.

```text
Gradient
   ↓
Steepest increase

Negative gradient
   ↓
Steepest decrease
```

---

### ❌ Mistake 3

Thinking learning rate should always be large.

No.

It must be appropriate for the optimization problem.

---

### ❌ Mistake 4

Thinking one update is enough.

Training normally requires repeated updates.

```text
Update
Update
Update
Update
...
```

